 563:../../CM7/LWIP/Target/ethernetif.c **** /**
 564:../../CM7/LWIP/Target/ethernetif.c ****  * @brief Should be called at the beginning of the program to set up the
 565:../../CM7/LWIP/Target/ethernetif.c ****  * network interface. It calls the function low_level_init() to do the
 566:../../CM7/LWIP/Target/ethernetif.c ****  * actual setup of the hardware.
